        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Is $(-6)^3$ equal to $-6^3$? Explain.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Yes, both equal $-216$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(-6)^3&=(-6)\\times(-6)\\times(-6)\\\\&=-216\\\\-6^3&=-(6\\times6\\times6)\\\\&=-216\\end{align*}$$\nWith an odd power, three negative factors give a negative result, matching the minus sign applied after cubing $6$.",
